  "description": "The toughest and most capable gravel bike we’ve ever designed, with tire clearance and geometry designed to conquer the roughest terrain. The Litespeed Flint frame is titanium gravel versatility in an economical package. Off-road sessions with friends, epic race adventures, bikepacking, and more: the Flint is the sharpest blade in your quiver. Engineered for versatility The Flint is engineered for versatility with increased stability, a relaxed riding position, and big tire clearance, delivering more comfort during long days in the saddle and more capability on rough terrain. Frame weight: 1,430 grams (size medium) Pure LW 3AL/2.5V titanium tubeset Full Integration (FI) hides brake housing, cables, and wiring Suspension-corrected geometry Universal Derailleur Hanger (UDH) Threaded T47i bottom bracket Maximum tire size: 54mm tire clearance* Proudly handcrafted in Chattanooga, TN, using globally sourced premium materials *Varies based on tire brand, tread, wheel, and fork combination.",
